        en: { name: 'Royal Botanic Gardens, Peradeniya', description: 'A vast garden in a loop of the Mahaweli River 6 km from Kandy, with an avenue of royal palms, an orchid house and a giant Javan fig whose canopy covers an entire lawn. Colonies of fruit bats hang in the trees.', tip: 'Start with the orchid house by the entrance, then head to the Great Lawn and the fig tree; come in the morning before the heat.' },
